OL,3,GNEWSAShould Scotland look to London and
OL,4,AManchester for inspiration on buses?
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney has been around Scottish
OL,7,Fpolitics long enough to have been
OL,8,Fcalled a few things by his critics -
OL,9,Fbut it's probably the first time he's
OL,10,Fbeen accused of behaving like "African
OL,11,Fdictators".
OL,13,FEmotive language like that is usually
OL,14,Fkept for the independence debate. This
OL,15,Ftime, it's over buses.
OL,17,FIn his SNP conference speech, the first
OL,18,Fminister produced a bit of a surprise
OL,19,Fwith a pledge to bring all of
OL,20,FScotland's bus networks under public
OL,21,Fcontrol by 2031.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
