OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAShould Scotland look to London and
OL,4,AManchester for inspiration on buses?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe industry has reacted with fury -
OL,7,Faccusing him of trying to "confiscate"
OL,8,Ftheir business. Bus operators say they
OL,9,Fhaven't been consulted, and that
OL,10,Fsmaller operators could be forced out
OL,11,Fof business.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
